window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Straw into Gold</i> is a Mystical Erotic Love story of one man and woman as they search for what at first seems impossible ~ to be reunited in this lifetime with their destined lover from the stars.</p> <p>Just as in the timeless tale of Rumpelstiltskin where he spins ordinary straw into gold, join the Wanderer and the Forest Maiden as they discover the lost art of forging the energies of love and sex into the alchemy of pure gold.</p> <p>Delight in sharing the cycle of one full year in their magical space of love near a spring-fed river in the distant mountains. Learn the forbidden secrets of Divine Union and Sacred Sex through the uplifting story of the man and woman who ignite A Love to Heal the Soul of the World.</p>"; 
